the word-count request scores 0 for every tool, so 'word_count' was chosen only by the sort tie-break, not by evidence"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 3: Tool access is per agent","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 3: Tool access is per agent","bodyEn":"What it ran: Tool access is per agent. What the lab concluded: This experiment prints data only; read the lines in the output below.","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: Tool access is per agent. ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): This experiment prints data only; read the lines in the output below."}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 3. Tool access is per agent ---
