short: ['user asked about CrewAI'] | entities: {'CrewAI': ['a framework for role-based agents']}"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 6: Word-overlap retrieval and its failure modes","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 6: Word-overlap retrieval and its failure modes","bodyEn":"What it ran: Word-overlap retrieval and its failure modes. What the lab concluded: This experiment prints data only; read the lines in the output below.","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: Word-overlap retrieval and its failure modes. ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): This experiment prints data only; read the lines in the output below."}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 6. Genuinely checking: word-overlap retrieval and its failure modes ---
