string matching rejects a correct patch; execution accepts it"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 6: A flaky candidate (passes ~80 percent per call)","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 6: A flaky candidate (passes ~80 percent per call)","bodyEn":"What it ran: A flaky candidate (passes ~80 percent per call). What the lab concluded: the expected rate is 0.8^2 = 64 percent, not 0.8^3, because the (4, 0) test passes whichever branch runs; a single run is not a verdict, so evaluators rerun or require determinism","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: A flaky candidate (passes ~80 percent per call). ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): the expected rate is 0.8^2 = 64 percent, not 0.8^3, because the (4, 0) test passes whichever branch runs; a single run is not a verdict, so evaluators rerun or require determinism"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 6. Genuinely measuring: a flaky candidate (passes ~80 percent per call) ---
