   violation: docs/login-guide.md | Outside allowed file patterns | warning
   violation: release/deploy.sh | Explicitly forbidden file | error"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 2: Acceptance evidence, a claim versus an execution","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 2: Acceptance evidence, a claim versus an execution","bodyEn":"What it ran: Acceptance evidence, a claim versus an execution. What the lab concluded: the failing test file made the real exit code non-zero, yet the self-reported list still said it passed and the first gate allowed the work; evidence has to come from the harness that ran the command, not from the agent's own summary","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: Acceptance evidence, a claim versus an execution. ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): the failing test file made the real exit code non-zero, yet the self-reported list still said it passed and the first gate allowed the work; evidence has to come from the harness that ran the command, not from the agent's own summary"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 2. Genuinely running: acceptance evidence, a claim versus an execution ---
gate trusting the agent's list: ALLOW
executed 'python -m unittest tests.test_login': exit 1
gate using executed results: BLOCK"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 3: Approvals compared as plain strings","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 3: Approvals compared as plain strings","bodyEn":"What it ran: Approvals compared as plain strings. What the lab concluded: the same intent written with capitals or a trailing space was rejected, which is safe but brittle, and the last case shows the check has no idea who approved: it only compares text, so an agent that writes its own approval string passes; real approvals need an identity and a record outside the agent's control","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: Approvals compared as plain strings. ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): the same intent written with capitals or a trailing space was rejected, which is safe but brittle, and the last case shows the check has no idea who approved: it only compares text, so an agent that writes its own approval string passes; real approvals need an identity and a record outside the agent's control"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 3. Genuinely running: approvals compared as plain strings ---
exact text                         {'passed': True, 'missing': []}
different capitals                 {'passed': False, 'missing': ['production deployment']}
trailing space                     {'passed': False, 'missing': ['production deployment']}
approved by nobody in particular   {'passed': True, 'missing': []}"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 4: A time budget checked after the fact versus enforced","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 4: A time budget checked after the fact versus enforced","bodyEn":"What it ran: A time budget checked after the fact versus enforced. What the lab concluded: the post-run check can only report that the budget was exceeded after the time was spent, while a timeout in the runner stopped the command at its limit; budgets belong in the runtime, with the report as the audit record","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: A time budget checked after the fact versus enforced. ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): the post-run check can only report that the budget was exceeded after the time was spent, while a timeout in the runner stopped the command at its limit; budgets belong in the runtime, with the report as the audit record"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 4. Genuinely running: a time budget checked after the fact versus enforced ---
post-run check, 45 minutes against a 30 minute budget: {'passed': False, 'elapsed': 45}
enforced budget of 1 s on a 30 s command: killed at the timeout after 1.0 s"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 5: The gate truth table","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 5: The gate truth table","bodyEn":"What it ran: The gate truth table. What the lab concluded: exactly one of the sixteen combinations allows the work, so adding another check can only block more, never allow more; that is also why a missing check silently widens the gate","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: The gate truth table. ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): exactly one of the sixteen combinations allows the work, so adding another check can only block more, never allow more; that is also why a missing check silently widens the gate"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 5. Genuinely measuring: the gate truth table ---
combinations of scope/acceptance/approvals/time: 16 | ALLOW: 1 | BLOCK: 15"}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Reading the Verified Output","textKn":"ಪರಿಶೀಲಿತ Output ಓದುವುದು","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Genuinely Found: Tests Passing Did Not Outweigh a Forbidden File","headingKn":"ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಕಂಡುಬಂದದ್ದು: ಪರೀಕ್ಷೆ ಪಾಸ್ ಆದರೂ ನಿಷೇಧಿತ ಫೈಲ್ ಮೀರಿಸಲಿಲ್ಲ","bodyEn":"Section 1: the compliant run was ALLOW. The scope-creep run was BLOCK with one error (release/deploy.sh, explicitly forbidden), one warning (docs/login-guide.md, outside the allowed patterns), approvals failed and acceptance true. Section 2: a gate that trusted the agent's list of passed commands said ALLOW for a project whose test file fails; running the command really exited 1, and the gate using that executed result said BLOCK.","bodyKn":"ವಿಭಾಗ 1: ಅನುಸರಿಸುವ ಓಟ ALLOW ಆಗಿತ್ತು. ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿ-ಮೀರುವ ಓಟ ಒಂದು ದೋಷ (release/deploy.sh, ಸ್ಪಷ್ಟವಾಗಿ ನಿಷೇಧಿತ), ಒಂದು ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ (docs/login-guide.md, ಅನುಮತಿಸಿದ ಮಾದರಿಗಳ ಹೊರಗೆ) ಇರುವ BLOCK ಆಗಿತ್ತು, ಅನುಮೋದನೆಗಳು ವಿಫಲ ಮತ್ತು ಸ್ವೀಕಾರ true. ವಿಭಾಗ 2: agent ಪಾಸ್ ಆದ ಆದೇಶಗಳ ಪಟ್ಟಿಯನ್ನು ನಂಬಿದ gate ವಿಫಲ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಾ ಫೈಲ್ ಇರುವ ಪ್ರಾಜೆಕ್ಟ್‌ಗೆ ALLOW ಎಂದಿತು; ಆದೇಶ ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಓಡಿಸಿದಾಗ 1 ನೊಂದಿಗೆ ನಿರ್ಗಮಿಸಿತು, ಮತ್ತು ಆ ಓಡಿಸಿದ ಫಲಿತಾಂಶ ಬಳಸಿದ gate BLOCK ಎಂದಿತು."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Genuinely Found: Approvals Are Strings and Budgets Are Reports","headingKn":"ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಕಂಡುಬಂದದ್ದು: ಅನುಮೋದನೆಗಳು ಸ್ಟ್ರಿಂಗ್‌ಗಳು ಮತ್ತು ಬಜೆಟ್‌ಗಳು ವರದಿಗಳು","bodyEn":"Section 3: "production deployment" matched exactly; different capitals and a trailing space were rejected, and an approval string with no approver identity passed. Section 4: 45 minutes against a 30-minute budget failed only after the fact, while a one-second timeout killed a 30-second command after 1.0 s. Section 5: of sixteen pass/fail combinations of the four checks exactly one allows the work.","bodyKn":"ವಿಭಾಗ 3: "production deployment" ನಿಖರವಾಗಿ ಹೊಂದಿತು; ಬೇರೆ ದೊಡ್ಡಕ್ಷರಗಳು ಮತ್ತು ಕೊನೆಯ ಖಾಲಿಸ್ಥಳ ತಿರಸ್ಕೃತವಾದವು, ಮತ್ತು ಅನುಮೋದಕರ ಗುರುತಿಲ್ಲದ ಅನುಮೋದನೆ ಸ್ಟ್ರಿಂಗ್ ಪಾಸ್ ಆಯಿತು. ವಿಭಾಗ 4: 30-ನಿಮಿಷ ಬಜೆಟ್ ವಿರುದ್ಧ 45 ನಿಮಿಷ ಘಟನೆಯ ನಂತರ ಮಾತ್ರ ವಿಫಲವಾಯಿತು, ಒಂದು-ಸೆಕೆಂಡ್ timeout 30-ಸೆಕೆಂಡ್ ಆದೇಶವನ್ನು 1.0 s ನಂತರ ಕೊಂದಿತು. ವಿಭಾಗ 5: ನಾಲ್ಕು ಪರಿಶೀಲನೆಗಳ ಹದಿನಾರು pass/fail ಸಂಯೋಜನೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಖರವಾಗಿ ಒಂದು ಕೆಲಸ ಅನುಮತಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Why AI Uses This","headingKn":"AI ಇದನ್ನು ಏಕೆ ಬಳಸುತ್ತದೆ","bodyEn":"The gate is only as strong as the evidence behind each input: executed results, a real approver and a runtime-enforced budget are what separate a gate from a printout.","bodyKn":"ಪ್ರತಿ ಇನ್‌ಪುಟ್ ಹಿಂದಿನ ಸಾಕ್ಷ್ಯದಷ್ಟೇ gate ಬಲಿಷ್ಠ: ಓಡಿಸಿದ ಫಲಿತಾಂಶಗಳು, ನಿಜ ಅನುಮೋದಕ ಮತ್ತು runtime ಜಾರಿಗೊಳಿಸುವ ಬಜೆಟ್ gate ಅನ್ನು ಮುದ್ರಣದಿಂದ ಬೇರ್ಪಡಿಸುತ್ತವೆ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Common Misconception","headingKn":"ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯ ತಪ್ಪು ಕಲ್ಪನೆ","bodyEn":"Misconception: "the tests passed, so the task is fine." A blocked run had its acceptance command recorded as passed.","bodyKn":"ತಪ್ಪು ಕಲ್ಪನೆ: "ಪರೀಕ್ಷೆಗಳು ಪಾಸ್ ಆದವು, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ಕಾರ್ಯ ಸರಿ." ತಡೆಯಲ್ಪಟ್ಟ ಓಟದ ಸ್ವೀಕಾರ ಆದೇಶ ಪಾಸ್ ಎಂದು ದಾಖಲಾಗಿತ್ತು."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Key Terms","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಮುಖ ಪದಗಳು","bodyEn":"Verification gate: the checkpoint that decides ALLOW or BLOCK. Violation severity: error blocks, warning counts against a budget. Acceptance evidence: an exit code recorded by the harness. Approval: a human decision with an identity. Timeout: a limit enforced while the command runs.","bodyKn":"Verification gate: ALLOW ಅಥವಾ BLOCK ನಿರ್ಧರಿಸುವ ಪರಿಶೀಲನಾ ಕೇಂದ್ರ. Violation severity: error ತಡೆಯುತ್ತದೆ, warning ಬಜೆಟ್ ವಿರುದ್ಧ ಎಣಿಕೆಯಾಗುತ್ತದೆ. Acceptance evidence: harness ದಾಖಲಿಸಿದ exit code. Approval: ಗುರುತಿರುವ ಮಾನವ ನಿರ್ಧಾರ. Timeout: ಆದೇಶ ಓಡುತ್ತಿರುವಾಗ ಜಾರಿಯಾಗುವ ಮಿತಿ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Key Takeaways","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಮುಖ ಅಂಶಗಳು","bodyEn":"1) The compliant run was ALLOW and the scope-creep run BLOCK with one error and one warning. 2) A claimed test pass gave ALLOW while the real run exited 1. 3) Capitals or a trailing space broke an approval and a bare string passed with no identity. 4) A timeout killed a command at 1.0 s where a post-run check only reported. 5) One of sixteen combinations allows.","bodyKn":"1) ಅನುಸರಿಸುವ ಓಟ ALLOW ಮತ್ತು ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿ-ಮೀರುವ ಓಟ ಒಂದು ದೋಷ ಹಾಗೂ ಒಂದು ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆಯೊಂದಿಗೆ BLOCK. 2) ಹೇಳಿದ ಪರೀಕ್ಷಾ ಪಾಸ್ ALLOW ನೀಡಿತು ಆದರೆ ನಿಜ ಓಟ 1 ನೊಂದಿಗೆ ನಿರ್ಗಮಿಸಿತು. 3) ದೊಡ್ಡಕ್ಷರ ಅಥವಾ ಕೊನೆಯ ಖಾಲಿಸ್ಥಳ ಅನುಮೋದನೆ ಮುರಿದವು ಮತ್ತು ಬರೀ ಸ್ಟ್ರಿಂಗ್ ಗುರುತಿಲ್ಲದೆ ಪಾಸ್ ಆಯಿತು. 4) timeout ಆದೇಶವನ್ನು 1.0 s ನಲ್ಲಿ ಕೊಂದಿತು, ಆದರೆ post-run ಪರಿಶೀಲನೆ ವರದಿ ಮಾತ್ರ ಮಾಡಿತು. 5) ಹದಿನಾರರಲ್ಲಿ ಒಂದು ಸಂಯೋಜನೆ ಅನುಮತಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Try It Yourself","textKn":"ನೀವೇ ಪ್ರಯತ್ನಿಸಿ","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Run the lab","headingKn":"ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಓಡಿಸಿ","bodyEn":"1) Open a terminal in pneuronics-backend/lesson-defs/labs. 2) Run: python -B sc_2.py (in Git Bash on Windows: PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8 python -B sc_2.py). 3) Compare each section with the walkthrough above. The -B flag stops Python from writing __pycache__ folders.","bodyKn":"1) pneuronics-backend/lesson-defs/labs ನಲ್ಲಿ ಟರ್ಮಿನಲ್ ತೆರೆಯಿರಿ. 2) ಓಡಿಸಿ: python -B sc_2.py (Windows Git Bash ನಲ್ಲಿ: PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8 python -B sc_2.py). 3) ಪ್ರತಿ ವಿಭಾಗವನ್ನು ಮೇಲಿನ ನಡೆದಾಟಕ್ಕೆ ಹೋಲಿಸಿ. -B ಧ್ವಜ Python __pycache__ ಫೋಲ್ಡರ್‌ಗಳನ್ನು ಬರೆಯುವುದನ್ನು ತಡೆಯುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"quiz","data":{"questions":[{"q":"What was the verdict for the scope-creep run?","qKn":"ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿ-ಮೀರುವ ಓಟದ ತೀರ್ಪು ಏನು?","opts":["ALLOW","BLOCK","WARN","SKIP"],"optsKn":["ALLOW","BLOCK","WARN","SKIP"],"correct":1},{"q":"What exit code did the real acceptance command return for the failing test?","qKn":"ವಿಫಲ ಪರೀಕ್ಷೆಗೆ ನಿಜ ಸ್ವೀಕಾರ ಆದೇಶ ಯಾವ exit code ಮರಳಿಸಿತು?","opts":["0","1","3","5"],"optsKn":["0","1","3","5"],"correct":1},{"q":"What happened to an approval string with different capitals?","qKn":"ಬೇರೆ ದೊಡ್ಡಕ್ಷರಗಳ ಅನುಮೋದನೆ ಸ್ಟ್ರಿಂಗ್‌ಗೆ ಏನಾಯಿತು?","opts":["Rejected","Accepted","Deleted","Ignored"],"optsKn":["ತಿರಸ್ಕೃತ","ಸ್ವೀಕೃತ","ಅಳಿಸಲಾಯಿತು","ನಿರ್ಲಕ್ಷಿಸಲಾಯಿತು"],"correct":0},{"q":"After how long did the one-second timeout stop the 30-second command?","qKn":"ಒಂದು-ಸೆಕೆಂಡ್ timeout 30-ಸೆಕೆಂಡ್ ಆದೇಶವನ್ನು ಎಷ್ಟು ಹೊತ್ತಿನ ನಂತರ ನಿಲ್ಲಿಸಿತು?","opts":["About 1.0 s","30 s","45 minutes","Never"],"optsKn":["ಸುಮಾರು 1.0 s","30 s","45 ನಿಮಿಷ","ಎಂದಿಗೂ ಇಲ್ಲ"],"correct":0},{"q":"How many of the sixteen check combinations allowed the work?","qKn":"ಹದಿನಾರು ಪರಿಶೀಲನಾ ಸಂಯೋಜನೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಎಷ್ಟು ಕೆಲಸ ಅನುಮತಿಸಿದವು?","opts":["1","4","8","16"],"optsKn":["1","4","8","16"],"correct":0}]}}]

