each thread_id has its own history, so thread_b did not replay thread_a results and the repeat run of thread_a replayed everything; 12 events are two threads of six each"}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Experiment Walkthrough","textKn":"Experiment ನಡೆದಾಟ","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 1: Crash after the second activity, then recover","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 1: Crash after the second activity, then recover","bodyEn":"What it ran: Crash after the second activity, then recover. What the lab concluded: the recovery run replayed collect_data and analyze_data from the log and executed only generate_report, so every body ran exactly once and the log holds six events, a started and a completed record for each of three activities","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: Crash after the second activity, then recover. ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): the recovery run replayed collect_data and analyze_data from the log and executed only generate_report, so every body ran exactly once and the log holds six events, a started and a completed record for each of three activities"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 1. Genuinely running: crash after the second activity, then recover ---
