activity bodies run in total: {'collect_data': 1, 'analyze_data': 1, 'generate_report': 1} | events on disk: 6"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 2: The same crash without durability","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 2: The same crash without durability","bodyEn":"What it ran: The same crash without durability. What the lab concluded: without a stored history the second run starts from the top, so the first two activities run twice and the total is five bodies against three; for an LLM call or a payment each avoided repeat is real cost","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: The same crash without durability. ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): without a stored history the second run starts from the top, so the first two activities run twice and the total is five bodies against three; for an LLM call or a payment each avoided repeat is real cost"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 2. Genuinely running: the same crash without durability ---
naive retry counters: {'collect_data': 2, 'analyze_data': 2, 'generate_report': 1} | total bodies run: 5 | durable total: 3"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 3: Input drift is rejected","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 3: Input drift is rejected","bodyEn":"What it ran: Input drift is rejected. What the lab concluded: the fingerprint of the arguments is stored with the first call, so a changed argument raises instead of silently returning the old answer; the fingerprint covers only the serialised arguments and not the function source or any model version","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: Input drift is rejected. ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): the fingerprint of the arguments is stored with the first call, so a changed argument raises instead of silently returning the old answer; the fingerprint covers only the serialised arguments and not the function source or any model version"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 3. Genuinely running: input drift is rejected ---
