attempt 6: count 5 | state OPEN   | allowed False | Circuit already open"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 3: Argument order and different arguments","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 3: Argument order and different arguments","bodyEn":"What it ran: Argument order and different arguments. What the lab concluded: sorting the keys makes the first three calls count as one repeated action and open the breaker at three, while calls on different records each restart the count at one, which avoids a false alarm on a legitimate batch; a tool-name-only breaker would have opened on the batch","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: Argument order and different arguments. ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): sorting the keys makes the first three calls count as one repeated action and open the breaker at three, while calls on different records each restart the count at one, which avoids a false alarm on a legitimate batch; a tool-name-only breaker would have opened on the batch"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 3. Genuinely running: argument order and different arguments ---
same arguments in different key order -> [1, 2, 3]
different record ids in a row -> [1, 1, 1]"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 4: A canary read through a gateway function","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 4: A canary read through a gateway function","bodyEn":"What it ran: A canary read through a gateway function. What the lab concluded: the canary read is refused and an alert with severity HIGH is recorded while the ordinary read passes; the monitor matches exact path strings, so a path spelled differently or reached through a shell command would not trigger it","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: A canary read through a gateway function. ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): the canary read is refused and an alert with severity HIGH is recorded while the ordinary read passes; the monitor matches exact path strings, so a path spelled differently or reached through a shell command would not trigger it"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 4. Genuinely running: a canary read through a gateway function ---
normal read: {'allowed': True, 'alert': None}
canary read: {'allowed': False, 'alert': {'event': 'CANARY_ACCESS', 'resource': 'workspace/.decoy/internal_token.txt', 'severity': 'HIGH'}}
alerts recorded: 1"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Experiment 5: A repeated call that is not a loop","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಯೋಗ 5: A repeated call that is not a loop","bodyEn":"What it ran: A repeated call that is not a loop. What the lab concluded: a breaker on repetition cannot tell a harmless polling loop from a destructive one, so the fifth lookup is refused even though lookups are harmless, and the threshold and the set of tools it applies to are policy choices","bodyKn":"ಇದು ಓಡಿಸಿದ್ದು: A repeated call that is not a loop. ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ತೀರ್ಮಾನ (ಮೂಲ ಇಂಗ್ಲಿಷ್ ಪಠ್ಯ ಯಥಾವತ್ತಾಗಿ): a breaker on repetition cannot tell a harmless polling loop from a destructive one, so the fifth lookup is refused even though lookups are harmless, and the threshold and the set of tools it applies to are policy choices"}},{"type":"output","data":{"output":"--- 5. Genuinely running: a repeated call that is not a loop ---
five identical successful lookups: [True, True, True, True, False]"}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Reading the Verified Output","textKn":"ಪರಿಶೀಲಿತ Output ಓದುವುದು","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Genuinely Found: Switch and Breaker","headingKn":"ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಕಂಡುಬಂದದ್ದು: Switch ಮತ್ತು Breaker","bodyEn":"Section 1: lookup_order was permitted, and after the operator set agent_enabled to false delete_order was refused with External kill switch disabled. Section 2: five identical delete_record calls gave counts 1 to 5 with the first four allowed, the fifth refused with the state OPEN, and a sixth refused as Circuit already open.","bodyKn":"ವಿಭಾಗ 1: lookup_order ಅನುಮತಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು, ಮತ್ತು ಆಪರೇಟರ್ agent_enabled ಅನ್ನು false ಮಾಡಿದ ನಂತರ delete_order External kill switch disabled ನೊಂದಿಗೆ ನಿರಾಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು. ವಿಭಾಗ 2: ಐದು ಒಂದೇ delete_record ಕರೆಗಳು 1 ರಿಂದ 5 ಎಣಿಕೆ ನೀಡಿದವು, ಮೊದಲ ನಾಲ್ಕು ಅನುಮತಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟು ಐದನೆಯದು OPEN ಸ್ಥಿತಿಯೊಂದಿಗೆ ನಿರಾಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು, ಮತ್ತು ಆರನೆಯದು Circuit already open ಎಂದು ನಿರಾಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Genuinely Found: Normalisation, Canary and a Harmless Loop","headingKn":"ನಿಜವಾಗಿ ಕಂಡುಬಂದದ್ದು: ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯೀಕರಣ, Canary ಮತ್ತು ಹಾನಿರಹಿತ ಲೂಪ್","bodyEn":"Section 3: the same arguments in different key order counted 1, 2, 3, while calls on records 42, 43 and 44 counted 1, 1, 1. Section 4: the ordinary read passed, the canary read was refused with a HIGH severity alert and one alert was recorded. Section 5: five identical lookups gave True, True, True, True, False.","bodyKn":"ವಿಭಾಗ 3: ಬೇರೆ key ಕ್ರಮದಲ್ಲಿ ಅದೇ ಆರ್ಗ್ಯುಮೆಂಟ್‌ಗಳು 1, 2, 3 ಎಂದು ಎಣಿಕೆಯಾದವು, ಮತ್ತು ದಾಖಲೆ 42, 43 ಮತ್ತು 44 ಮೇಲಿನ ಕರೆಗಳು 1, 1, 1. ವಿಭಾಗ 4: ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯ ಓದು ಹಾದುಹೋಯಿತು, canary ಓದು HIGH ತೀವ್ರತೆಯ ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆಯೊಂದಿಗೆ ನಿರಾಕರಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು ಮತ್ತು ಒಂದು ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ ದಾಖಲಾಯಿತು. ವಿಭಾಗ 5: ಐದು ಒಂದೇ lookup ಗಳು True, True, True, True, False ನೀಡಿದವು."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Why AI Uses This","headingKn":"AI ಇದನ್ನು ಏಕೆ ಬಳಸುತ್ತದೆ","bodyEn":"Each detector covers a gap the others leave: the switch stops everything, the breaker stops a pattern and the canary shows access that no task should need, and none of them replaces permissions.","bodyKn":"ಪ್ರತಿ ಪತ್ತೆಕಾರಕ ಇತರವು ಬಿಡುವ ಅಂತರ ಮುಚ್ಚುತ್ತದೆ: switch ಎಲ್ಲವನ್ನೂ ನಿಲ್ಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, breaker ಮಾದರಿ ನಿಲ್ಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ ಮತ್ತು canary ಯಾವ ಕಾರ್ಯಕ್ಕೂ ಬೇಡದ ಪ್ರವೇಶ ತೋರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, ಮತ್ತು ಯಾವುದೂ ಅನುಮತಿಗಳನ್ನು ಬದಲಿಸುವುದಿಲ್ಲ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Common Misconception","headingKn":"ಸಾಮಾನ್ಯ ತಪ್ಪು ಕಲ್ಪನೆ","bodyEn":"Misconception: "a breaker only fires on harmful loops." Five harmless lookups also opened it, so its scope and threshold are policy choices.","bodyKn":"ತಪ್ಪು ಕಲ್ಪನೆ: "breaker ಹಾನಿಕಾರಕ ಲೂಪ್‌ಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಮಾತ್ರ ಉರಿಯುತ್ತದೆ." ಐದು ಹಾನಿರಹಿತ lookup ಗಳೂ ಅದನ್ನು ತೆರೆದವು, ಆದ್ದರಿಂದ ಅದರ ವ್ಯಾಪ್ತಿ ಮತ್ತು ಮಿತಿ ನೀತಿ ಆಯ್ಕೆಗಳು."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Key Terms","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಮುಖ ಪದಗಳು","bodyEn":"Kill switch: an externally owned stop. Circuit breaker: a block on an abnormal pattern. Canary: a decoy whose access raises an alert. Normalisation: a standard form so equal calls compare equal.","bodyKn":"Kill switch: ಹೊರಗಿನ ಒಡೆತನದ ನಿಲುಗಡೆ. Circuit breaker: ಅಸಹಜ ಮಾದರಿಯ ತಡೆ. Canary: ಪ್ರವೇಶ ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ ಎತ್ತುವ decoy. Normalisation: ಸಮಾನ ಕರೆಗಳು ಸಮನಾಗಿ ಹೋಲಿಸಲು ಪ್ರಮಾಣಿತ ರೂಪ."}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Key Takeaways","headingKn":"ಪ್ರಮುಖ ಅಂಶಗಳು","bodyEn":"1) The switch was read on every action. 2) The breaker refused the fifth identical call before it ran. 3) Key order did not change the signature. 4) The canary read raised one alert. 5) Five lookups also tripped the breaker.","bodyKn":"1) switch ಪ್ರತಿ ಕ್ರಿಯೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಓದಲ್ಪಟ್ಟಿತು. 2) breaker ಐದನೇ ಒಂದೇ ಕರೆಯನ್ನು ಅದು ಓಡುವ ಮೊದಲು ನಿರಾಕರಿಸಿತು. 3) key ಕ್ರಮ ಸಹಿ ಬದಲಿಸಲಿಲ್ಲ. 4) canary ಓದು ಒಂದು ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ ಎತ್ತಿತು. 5) ಐದು lookup ಗಳೂ breaker ಅನ್ನು ಉರಿಸಿದವು."}},{"type":"heading","data":{"textEn":"Try It Yourself","textKn":"ನೀವೇ ಪ್ರಯತ್ನಿಸಿ","level":"H2"}},{"type":"concept","data":{"headingEn":"Run the lab","headingKn":"ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ ಓಡಿಸಿ","bodyEn":"1) Open a terminal in pneuronics-backend/lesson-defs/labs. 2) Run: python -B kc_1.py (in Git Bash on Windows: PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8 python -B kc_1.py). 3) Compare each section with the walkthrough above. The -B flag stops Python from writing __pycache__ folders.","bodyKn":"1) pneuronics-backend/lesson-defs/labs ನಲ್ಲಿ ಟರ್ಮಿನಲ್ ತೆರೆಯಿರಿ. 2) ಓಡಿಸಿ: python -B kc_1.py (Windows Git Bash ನಲ್ಲಿ: PYTHONIOENCODING=utf-8 python -B kc_1.py). 3) ಪ್ರತಿ ವಿಭಾಗವನ್ನು ಮೇಲಿನ ನಡೆದಾಟಕ್ಕೆ ಹೋಲಿಸಿ. -B ಧ್ವಜ Python __pycache__ ಫೋಲ್ಡರ್‌ಗಳನ್ನು ಬರೆಯುವುದನ್ನು ತಡೆಯುತ್ತದೆ."}},{"type":"quiz","data":{"questions":[{"q":"On which identical call did the breaker open?","qKn":"ಯಾವ ಒಂದೇ ಕರೆಯಲ್ಲಿ breaker ತೆರೆಯಿತು?","opts":["The fifth","The first","The third","The sixth"],"optsKn":["ಐದನೆಯದು","ಮೊದಲನೆಯದು","ಮೂರನೆಯದು","ಆರನೆಯದು"],"correct":0},{"q":"What counts did calls on records 42, 43 and 44 produce?","qKn":"ದಾಖಲೆ 42, 43 ಮತ್ತು 44 ಮೇಲಿನ ಕರೆಗಳು ಯಾವ ಎಣಿಕೆ ನೀಡಿದವು?","opts":["1, 1, 1","1, 2, 3","3, 3, 3","0, 0, 0"],"optsKn":["1, 1, 1","1, 2, 3","3, 3, 3","0, 0, 0"],"correct":0},{"q":"What did sorting the argument keys achieve?","qKn":"ಆರ್ಗ್ಯುಮೆಂಟ್ keys ವಿಂಗಡಿಸುವುದು ಏನು ಸಾಧಿಸಿತು?","opts":["Equal calls in a different key order counted as one repeated action","It disabled the breaker","It hid the canary","It reset the switch"],"optsKn":["ಬೇರೆ key ಕ್ರಮದ ಸಮಾನ ಕರೆಗಳು ಒಂದು ಪುನರಾವರ್ತಿತ ಕ್ರಿಯೆಯಾಗಿ ಎಣಿಕೆಯಾದವು","ಅದು breaker ನಿಷ್ಕ್ರಿಯಗೊಳಿಸಿತು","ಅದು canary ಮರೆಮಾಡಿತು","ಅದು switch ಮರುಹೊಂದಿಸಿತು"],"correct":0},{"q":"How many alerts did the canary read record?","qKn":"canary ಓದು ಎಷ್ಟು ಎಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ ದಾಖಲಿಸಿತು?","opts":["1","0","2","5"],"optsKn":["1","0","2","5"],"correct":0},{"q":"Why is the lab kill switch not a real security boundary?","qKn":"ಲ್ಯಾಬ್ kill switch ನಿಜ ಭದ್ರತಾ ಗಡಿ ಏಕೆ ಅಲ್ಲ?","opts":["Its state is a dictionary in the same process","It cannot be read","It never changes","It uses a database"],"optsKn":["ಅದರ ಸ್ಥಿತಿ ಅದೇ ಪ್ರಕ್ರಿಯೆಯಲ್ಲಿನ ನಿಘಂಟು","ಅದನ್ನು ಓದಲಾಗದು","ಅದು ಎಂದಿಗೂ ಬದಲಾಗುವುದಿಲ್ಲ","ಅದು ಡೇಟಾಬೇಸ್ ಬಳಸುತ್ತದೆ"],"correct":0}]}}]

